  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.22 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Licensure for Land Surveyors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.22 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Licensure for Land Surveyors. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.22, below, shall apply to the profession regulated by the board of licensure for land surveyors under RSA 310-A:53-74:\n\nTable 1002.22 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Licensure for Land Surveyors\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nLand surveyor in training certification application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $165\n\nLand surveyor license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of active license | 2 years | $165\n\nRenewal or reinstatement after expiration of retired license | 2 years | $82\n\nLand surveyor business entity certificate of authorization application processing and licensing, all forms:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $110\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35 (formerly Plc 1002.21)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
